    s__ARRIVAL_LATE_NOTE(py_str("Check the last metro or bus before you travel - in most cities it is between half eleven and half twelve - and if it has gone, take the rank outside the station or ring the hotel and ask them to book a car, rather than getting in with someone who offers. Tell the hotel you will be late so they hold the room and give you the door code, and keep 20 euros of cash on you for the ride."));
    s__ARRIVAL_ABOUT_NOTE(py_str("Tap a contactless bank card or your phone if the city takes it, and you pay the local fare with no ticket to buy or validate; otherwise get a day or three-day travel card from the machine, which usually pays off after three or four rides. Validate the ticket or tap in at the start of every journey, because an unvalidated one counts as no ticket, and keep the same card for the way back so the daily cap applies."));
